WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now I thought I'd share
some of my favorite

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:03.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
#MyWeirdRoommate
stories from you guys.

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:06.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
This first one is from
@hoseway.

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:07.574 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:09.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, H-O-S-E.
-Oh.

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:11.077 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Like a garden hose.
-Oh.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:13.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He says, "My roommate would
lay on the couch

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:14.614 size:84% position:42% line:92%
"watching TV shirtless.

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:16.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
"He would have ranch dressing
on one side of his chest,

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:19.652
"cheese dip on the other,
and a mountain of chips

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.154 size:88% position:44% line:92%
resting on his stomach."

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:22.956 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience groans ]

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:23.790 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-That's the hose way.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.759 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's the hose way
right there, man.

00:00:25.759 --> 00:00:27.193 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, man.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:28.795 line:92%
-This one's from @karamisu.

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:30.897 size:81% position:41%
She says, "In college,
my roommate came to me

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:33.900 align:start size:94% position:6%
"in a panic and told me
her snake got out.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had no idea
she had a snake."

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh!
-"What do you mean?

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:40.507 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
There's a snake?"

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:42.542 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-At 818.

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:45.545 line:92%
-This one's from @Jacobchiller.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:48.381 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Ooh! Scary!

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh, @Jacobchiller.
He says,

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:52.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
"My roommate would come home
drunk holding his shoes

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:54.220
"by the laces, swing them
around like nunchucks,

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
"and attack me
while I was trying to sleep,

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.690 line:92%
yelling, 'I'm Michelangelo!'"

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.460 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
[ Slurs ] "I'm Michelangelo!"

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.095 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:03.963 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Dude.

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:05.598 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:09.969 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This next one is from
@audrey87024230.

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:11.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
She says, "If the vending
machine didn't have

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:15.408
"cheddar sour cream chips,
my roommate would lie on her bed

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:16.209 size:75% position:38% line:92%
"in sadness and say,

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:19.312
'When the vending machine
is empty, I am empty.'"

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:21.247 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:24.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm with the roommate.
-Cheddar sour cream chips.

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:25.518 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-I'm with the roommate.

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:28.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This one's from
@LakeShowFanatic.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:30.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
He says, "I had a roommate
that would pour

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.792 size:75% position:38%
"toilet bowl cleaner
on his dirty dishes,

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:33.793 align:start size:94% position:6%
"then leave them
in the sink.

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:35.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
"He said, 'If it's good enough
to clean toilets,

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:37.163 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's good enough
to clean plates.'"

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:38.898 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh!
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:40.700 size:84% position:42%
-[ Imitates spitting ]
-What was on the plate?

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, he's doing chaw too.
-Yeah.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hey, if it's good enough
for..."

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:46.306 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Imitating spitting ]
Ding!

00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:48.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Good enough
to clean them plates."

00:01:48.575 --> 00:01:49.843 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:49.843 --> 00:01:52.345 line:92%
-This one's from @jasonaland.

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:55.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
He says, "My college roommate
bought size 22 sneakers,

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:57.183 align:start size:94% position:6%
"put them in the middle
of our living room,

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:59.486 align:start size:94% position:6%
"just so when people came over
and saw them he could say,

00:01:59.486 --> 00:02:01.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Oh, my girlfriend's
in the shower.'"

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:05.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter
and scattered applause ]

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:08.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ] God, what's --
Where's the win?

00:02:08.595 --> 00:02:10.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't know, man.
-Yeah. So people --

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
What did he expect
the reaction would be?

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:14.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, okay."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:16.302
-I guess you'd be like,
"Wow. She's really tall."

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:18.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Yeah, oh, she's tall."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:21.541 size:84% position:42%
-That was a good bit.
I kind of like it, man.

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:22.775 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:24.844
I give you props. I think
it's -- I think it's funny.

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:26.079 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, you're going to do
that one?

00:02:26.079 --> 00:02:27.447 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think that's
a funny bit, man.

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:29.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
This last one here is from
@diane-kinkade.

00:02:29.516 --> 00:02:31.584 align:start size:94% position:6%
She says, "My college roommate
tried to kill a spider

00:02:31.584 --> 00:02:33.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
"that was on the window pane
with a hammer.

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:35.221 align:start size:94% position:6%
She missed the spider."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:36.489 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like --
-[ Imitating shatter ]

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:38.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
